            %p
              If we extend the graded commutators in the evident way we may write the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential"} differential
              in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Cone
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi Der
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi 𝒪
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi C
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mover
                      %mo →
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                        %mover
                          %mi S
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                        %mo ,
                        %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
